 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "house and street are lists of trade strings \"SYMBOL,SIDE,QUANTITY,ID\": SYMBOL is 1 to 4 capital letters left-padded with spaces to 4 characters, SIDE is \"B\" or \"S\", QUANTITY is 4 digits and ID is 6 capital letters or digits. Trades may repeat. Level 2 (inferred extension): first match identical trades one-to-one as in level 1. Then, among the remaining trades, a house trade and a street trade match when SYMBOL, SIDE and QUANTITY agree (the ID may differ): for each such key, sort the remaining house trades and the remaining street trades of that key by code point and pair them in that order, so the largest ones are left over. Return every trade left unmatched after both rounds, sorted by code point.",
  "provenance": [
   {
    "repository": "gamma",
    "revision": null,
    "path": "projects/algorithm_solver/catalogue/authored/hack2hire-chunk14-a-20261028-v1/contracts.json",
